<title>MEXICO: Acer says obtains TI notebook rights.</title>
<headline>Acer says obtains TI notebook rights.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acer Computec Latin America, S.A. (Acer) said on Wednesday it had obtained the rights to distribute Texas Instruments notebook computers in Latin America.</p>
<p>It said the rights were obtained without cost as part of Grupo Acer's purchase of Texas Instruments Mobile Computing Business.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7902))</p>
